{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>The second time</b><br>He answered: There is none comparable to the lily of the valleys [which is near to taking it] except you are comparable among the daughters like a lily among the thorns." "<b>The third time</b><br>The Shekhinah answered: I will set you like a lily among the thorns, so that no person can touch it."], :book :song-of-songs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra's commentary on the Canticles" "http://beta.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH002030344/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:43:59.379192331Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}